  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OECD Ukraine Tax Capacity Building Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact: Support for Ukraine in adapting its tax system to address the challenges of the Russian war of aggression and in beginning to prepare for post-conflict internation economic integration. Components:                                        
1. Comprehensive implementation of BEPS (Base Erosion and Profit Shifting) recommendation
2. Motivating voluntary tax compliance for MNEs (MultiNational Enterprises), and other taxpayers in Ukraine
3. Tax implication for displaced population and enhancing compliance strategies for high-net worth individuals
4. Enhancing capacities of Ukraine in tackling the tax crimes and offences
5. Consolidation of the tax transparency standards to promote taxpayers&#x2019; compliance and enhance domestic resource mobilisation</narrative>
  </description>
